# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# OpenClaw Crew — Git Ignore
# Keeps secrets, credentials, sessions, and runtime data
# out of version control.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── Secrets (CRITICAL — never commit these) ─────────────
.env
*.env
!.env.example
secrets.json
*.age
*.gpg
*.pem
*.key

# ─── OpenClaw credentials and session data ───────────────
agents/
sessions/
credentials/
auth-profiles.json
models.json

# ─── Runtime and logs ────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log
*.jsonl
cron/runs/
sandboxes/

# ─── Obsidian internal config (vault content IS tracked) ─
workspace-cooper/vault/.obsidian/

# ─── OS junk ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
